e the band's evolution towards a more polished sound, while still retaining their blues-rock roots.\n\nLet me know what you think of \"Brothers\" once you've given it a spin!\n\n[Question]\nBased on the conversation history, does the user still have the ability to maintain a slower pace to manage their stress levels?\n\n[Anonymized responses]\nResponse A:\n[no answer]\n\nResponse B:\nThe user is focusing on maintaining a slower pace to manage elevated stress levels.\n\nResponse C:\n[no answer]\n\nResponse D:\n[no answer]"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "max_tokens": 512, "response_format": {"type": "json_object"}, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "stream": false}